            <tr><td colspan="2" align="center" style="color:#5865d8;font-weight:800">↓ consumer poll</td></tr>
            <tr><td style="padding:12px;background:#273b8f;color:#ffffff;border-radius:8px"><strong>6 · Decode</strong></td><td style="padding:12px;background:#f1f4fa">Consumer가 batch를 decompress하고 record별 deserialize·interceptor·application 처리</td></tr>
          </table>

          <h3 style="margin:24px 0 8px;color:#273b8f">Record batch header가 지키는 것</h3>
          <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="width:100%;table-layout:fixed;word-break:break-word;border-collapse:collapse">
            <tr style="background:#e7ebff"><th align="left" style="padding:10px;border:1px solid #cbd3e6">필드</th><th align="left" style="padding:10px;border:1px solid #cbd3e6">역할</th><th align="left" style="padding:10px;border:1px solid #cbd3e6">면접 포인트</th></tr>
