            <tr style="background:#e7ebff"><th align="left" style="padding:10px;border:1px solid #cbd3e6">상태</th><th align="left" style="padding:10px;border:1px solid #cbd3e6">소유자</th><th align="left" style="padding:10px;border:1px solid #cbd3e6">불변식·성공 의미</th></tr>
            <tr><td style="padding:10px;border:1px solid #cbd3e6">Partition batch buffer</td><td style="padding:10px;border:1px solid #cbd3e6">Producer accumulator</td><td style="padding:10px;border:1px solid #cbd3e6">같은 partition record만 batch되며 size/linger/sender 조건으로 전송 가능 상태가 된다.</td></tr>
